SUMMARY:THE WEAVE - A Malvern Buzzards Grand Day Out!
DESCRIPTION:Leader: Sim Buzzard\n\nAre you ready to take on The Weave?\n\nS
 tarting in Stourbridge and going to all five (current) Weavers Real Ale Hou
 se (Stourbridge\, Bewdley\, Kidderminster\, Worcester and Malvern). Shortes
 t route about 34 miles.\n\nDrink in each.\n\nRaising funds for Cardiac Risk
  in the Young (CRY) in memory of Matthew Notley. Please try and raise or do
 nate at least £34 (pound a mile).\n\nWhether you want to go for the Fastes
 t Known Time or plan the shortest possible route or just have a grand socia
 l\, this proves to be a huge event.\n\nThe Weavers team are backing us and 
 will be giving a warm welcome at each checkpoint. \n\nShorter versions avai
 lable if you only want to do a couple of stops. \n\nPre-run train ride on t
 he Stourbridge branch line. \n\nGather at Stourbridge Weavers for noon\, ev
 ent will start at 1230.\n\nAll welcome.\n\nSim Buzzard \n[Phone Number Reda
 cted]\n\nGather at \n\nView on Strava: https://www.strava.com/clubs/208705/
 group_events/3498740185001286416\n\nSynced from Strava Club 208705 on Sun\,
  28 Jun @ 1:50 PM
